> - `["2026-05-20", "2026-05-21"]` — list of date strings
> - `[{"date": "2026-05-20"}, ...]` — list of objects
> - Other format
>
> → **Action:** Will add a print statement to discover the format on first run, then finalize the parser.

> [!IMPORTANT]
> **Q2 — Week start day:** For weekly bookings, should the 5-day window always be Mon–Fri (ignoring the exact tap), or start from the tapped date? Currently planned to start from the tapped date (any day → +4 days).
